      ],
      "content": "building or masonry stone (Latin petra/petrum): worked stone for building, including rectangularly dressed (squared) stone, Caen stone, and stone supplied to masons or for making moulds and templates. The weight unit \"stone\" (14 lb.) is a distinct sense, recorded under stone."
    }
